 "description": "List commissions (rewards owed for referred customers' payments) newest first, with amount in cents, currency and state (pending, due, paid, voided). Filter by affiliate or state; expand the sale (with referral, customer and affiliate) or campaign. Rewardful: GET /v1/commissions.",
